<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeCountChildren</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to get the number of child nodes of a branch</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">size_t SilikoNodeCountChildren(
    const SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeCountChildren</function> function gets the
number of children a <varname>object</varname> has.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para>If <varname>object</varname> is a branch node, the return value is
the number of child nodes in <varname>object</varname>. Otherwise, the
return value is 0.</para>
</refsection>
